WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.354
Neb nins sẽn dat tɩ b maag b yĩng, tɩ b rog b kamba, la tɩ b wom b biis sõma wã, b kẽnda ne kũun n wa zĩ-gãongẽ wã.

00:00:08.434 --> 00:00:12.021
B yetame tɩ b sã n wa n deeg-b-la, b kelgd-b lame.

00:00:12.101 --> 00:00:17.448
B sã n pa mi b sẽn tõe n maan bũmb ningã, b na n wa maana rẽ ne pʋ-peelem.
